Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 04:39:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] art(SKU-50): real 16x16 item textures replacing flat
 placeholders

Hand-authored pixel art for 13 standalone items (cnc_bit, cnc_cutter,
melted_capacitor, burnt_cable_debris, charred_developer_circuit, myposhko_script,
egor_core, correct_matter_microcapsule, antizoomer_core, correct_developer_schematic,
normis_singularity, absolute_pohuit, arturian_mainframe). pravilnaya_vesh/pukan_core
(already animated art) and the 3 circuit boards (SKU-53) left untouched.
